{"id":"bfb69740eadd1eee","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-generated-substructure.md","title":"Substructure Generated by a Nonempty Set","display":"df-generated-substructure — Substructure Generated by a Nonempty Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-generated-substructure","aliases":["17-df-generated-substructure"],"display":"df-generated-substructure — Substructure Generated by a Nonempty Set","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"1.3","source_pages_print":[34],"source_pages_djvu":[50],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local formulation","source_result":"Exercises 1.3.9–1.3.10","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]"],"local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-generated-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-generated-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generated-substructure — Substructure Generated by a Nonempty Set"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local formulation"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Exercises 1.3.9–1.3.10"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_X\">\\(\\mathcal J_X\\)</span> 是下式定义的解释函数图，定义域由互不相交的常元、各元数函数和关系符号分支确定。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne X\\subseteq A\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne X\\subseteq A\\)</span>；语言分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>，子结构关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)\">\\(B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)\\)</span> 为生成载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle X\\rangle_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\langle X\\rangle_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 为下面构造的语言结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nB_{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq A:X\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}\\in Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;(f^{\\mathfrak A}[Y^n]\\subseteq Y)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J_X&amp;:=\\{(c,c^{\\mathfrak A}):c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(f,f^{\\mathfrak A}\\!\\upharpoonright B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)^n):n\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(R,R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)^n):n\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\},\\\\\n\\langle X\\rangle_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;:=(B_{\\mathfrak A}(X),\\mathcal J_X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nB_{\\mathfrak A}(X)&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq A:X\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}\\in Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;(f^{\\mathfrak A}[Y^n]\\subseteq Y)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal J_X&amp;:=\\{(c,c^{\\mathfrak A}):c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(f,f^{\\mathfrak A}\\!\\upharpoonright B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)^n):n\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(R,R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)^n):n\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\},\\\\\n\\langle X\\rangle_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;:=(B_{\\mathfrak A}(X),\\mathcal J_X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Exercises 1.3.9–1.3.10，印刷 p.34。闭合集族含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，故非空；交集包含非空的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，并对全部解释函数封闭。因而所得解释均有正确型别，且这是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的最小子结构。限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 避免无常元关系语言中生成载体为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"tar